        "endIndex": 653,
        "text": "#### **[14] Sam Altman confirms OpenAI will not go public in 2026, citing AI safety**\n* **What is confirmed:** In a *Fortune* interview published 12 September 2026, OpenAI CEO Sam Altman confirmed that OpenAI will not pursue an IPO in 2026"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 655,
        "endIndex": 815,
        "text": "Altman explicitly stated, *\"Given everything happening with safety, right now would be an ill-advised moment to go public, and we don't feel pressure on that.\"*"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        1
      ]
    },
